    "detailed_description": "Bilattice is a massive puzzle game featuring over 300 hand-crafted levels and tons of unique mechanics. The mechanics interact with each other in endlessly interesting ways to produce hours of mind-bending content. The sheer number of clever gimmicks offered by this game is hard not to appreciate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you learn the rules as you go through thoughtful level design that is meant to walk you through a series of realizations. Every puzzle is purposeful. But for those who prefer a more overt helping hand, tutorials and accessibility options are offered.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game also goes totally off the rails for the optional, bonus content. Bilattice is a game that goes all in on any wild concept the developer could think up.",
